# AI Agents (Cookie Bite)

All site assistants share the **storefront brain** (`lib/mr-brownie/brain/`) via `lib/ai-agent/`:

| Agent ID | UI | API |
|----------|-----|-----|
| `mr_brownie` | Mr. Brownie widget | `/api/mr-brownie/chat/stream` |
| `storefront_chat` | Demo `/demo/ai-chat` | `/api/chat` |
| `mrs_cookie` | Mrs. Cookie admin | `/api/admin/copilot/chat` |
| `product_wizard` | Product assistant | `/api/admin/product-assistant/chat` |

**Shared post-response:** `finalizeAgentResponse()` → supervisor (critic + coach) + `logAgentTurn()`.

**Storefront prepare:** `prepareStorefrontAgentChat()` — full CONTEXT JSON (catalog, brain, few-shot, memory).

**Admin copilot:** `buildCopilotBrainMeta()` + `BRAIN_CONTEXT` in system prompt; same supervisor.

Do not add a new chat route without wiring `AI_AGENT_IDS` + supervisor + turn logs.
